.SH NAME
dotty-packages-status - List the profile's packages and whether they are installed.


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdotty packages status [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the profile's tools with their installed versions (mise ls --global)
and its bootstrap packages with their state (mise bootstrap packages
status).


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for status


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--profile\fP=""
	profile to operate on (defaults to the active profile)


.SH EXAMPLE
